  "$comment": "Vietnamese stocks (config/assets.json, display.chain \"hose\"): where market-data reads HOSE matched trades and the USD/VND rate. Source is a public, unofficial chart API until an official keyed feed (SSI FastConnect) is set up; see OPEN_QUESTIONS.md B98.",
